   "It convinces you that because someone else is ahead in one area, you’re failing in yours.",
   "But that’s not how life works.",
   "One of the greatest lessons I’ve had to learn is this:",
   "People can be on different timelines and still be exactly where they need to be.",
   "I used to wonder why my journey seemed longer than other people’s.",
