   "Then I realized something that completely changed my perspective.",
   "Failure is not the opposite of success.",
   "Failure is often part of the journey to success.",
   "Think about a child learning to walk.",
   "Nobody expects the child to stand up perfectly on the first attempt.",
   "The child falls.",
   "Gets up.",
   "Falls again.",
   "Tries again.",
   "Eventually…",
   "Walking becomes natural.",
   "Imagine if that child decided,",
   "“Since I fell, walking must not be for me.”",
   "That sounds ridiculous.",
   "Yet many adults do exactly that with their dreams.",
   "One rejection…",
   "And they stop applying.",
   "One failed business…",
   "And they stop dreaming.",
   "One unsuccessful interview…",
   "And they stop believing.",
   "One disappointing relationship…",
   "And they stop loving.",
   "One bad presentation…",
   "And they stop speaking.",
   "One negative comment…",
   "And they stop creating.",
   "Failure has convinced too many people that one chapter is the entire story.",
   "It isn’t.",
   "Failure is information.",
   "It tells you what worked.",
