   "The patience to forgive?",
   "The wisdom to manage a home?",
   "The discipline to steward finances?",
   "The strength to keep choosing love even when feelings change?",
   "Imagine praying for influence.",
   "Can you carry criticism without becoming bitter?",
   "Can you remain faithful when people misunderstand you?",
   "Can you stay humble when people begin to celebrate you?",
   "These are not comfortable questions.",
   "But they are necessary ones.",
   "Because God is not only interested in giving us blessings.",
   "He is also interested in preparing us to carry them well.",
   "I’ve learned that waiting seasons are rarely wasted seasons.",
   "They’re classrooms.",
   "They’re training grounds.",
   "They’re opportunities to become stronger, wiser, kinder, and more faithful.",
   "Looking back at my own life, I can see it clearly.",
